        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MicroMechanica</strong> is a top-down factory-building game where you tackle handcrafted levels that unlock progressively, each introducing new mechanics and increasing difficulty as you advance. Build machines, optimize layouts, and discover clever solutions as you assemble intricate production systems in tightly designed mechanical puzzles across a variety of unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Resources and Build Machines</strong><br>Build machines to collect resources, and use those resources to build more machines. Create increasingly complex and efficient factories, improving your production and yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong><br>As you progress, unlock different colors and patterns to personalize your machines and make your factory uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Progression:</strong> 20 handcrafted levels, each with unique resource goals, logistical challenges, and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory Building:</strong> Construct factories from a top-down perspective, optimizing layouts for efficiency and productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Personalize your machines with colors and patterns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Levels:</strong> Additional handcrafted levels with new biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Machines: </strong>Additional machines and resources.</p></li></ul>",
